# Butler Routes - Orgrimmar recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and schematics sold by vendors spawning inside Orgrimmar (zone 1454), verified against the local Forever game data. 119 recipes across 121 vendor links
# (see docs/horde-city-recipes-inventory.md), including the Winter Veil seasonal pair.
# Each step is gated to its profession; the one pattern that names no profession anywhere in the data
# ships ungated with an honest note. No stock-class flag exists in the data,
# so nothing is marked limited.
guide butler-routes-completionist/orgrimmar-recipes
title Orgrimmar - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-60
zone Orgrimmar
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords orgrimmar, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

